4 >Search in Rotated Sorted Array

We need two condition for the problem

1, split the array in and check the left half is sorted or not 
  if sorted then check for the target is in that range 
  if yes then move the high to  the mid - 1
else then check whether the target is in the right range 
  if yes then move the low - mid + 1


